#para(((emph: "", text: "One use only. The character can use this ability at the start of any Magic phase, immediately after rolling for the Winds of Magic. All enemy Wizards within 18\" must immediately roll 2D6 on the Miscast table."),))
#namecost("WORD OF AGONY", "30 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Once per game, at the beginning of the Close Combat phase (before challenges are issued), the character can choose a model in base contact. That model takes D6 Strength 4 hits which Ignores Armour saves."),))
#namecost("SERPENT BODY", "15 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Model on foot only. The character gains +2 Movement, +1 Initiative and the Swiftstride special rule. This mutation cannot be combined with Cloven Hooves."),))
#namecost("SOPORIFIC MUSK", "15 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "When a unit flees from the character or the unit they are with, the fleeing unit rolls an extra D6 and discards the highest dice roll."),))
#namecost("ALLURE OF SLAANESH", "10 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Any opponent wishing to strike the character in close combat must first pass a Psychology test before rolling To Hit. If the test is failed, that model cannot make any close combat attacks that phase. This does not affect Attacks that do not roll To Hit."),))
#namecost("POWERS OF TZEENTCH", "")
#para(((emph: "italic", text: "The following powers may only be taken by characters with the Mark of Tzeentch or Daemon of Tzeentch."),), style: "italic")
#namecost("TENDRILS OF TZEENTCH", "30 points")
