#items(((runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "The King of Ashes:"), (emph: "", text: " At the start of each of your turns, one unit within 12\" of Khazek may be forced to take a Psychology test. If the test is failed the unit is overcome by the urge to slaughter in Khorne’s name, and they will gain the Frenzy special rule until the start of your next turn.")), sub: ()), (runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Scorn for Sorcery:"), (emph: "", text: " Khazek can channel Dispel Dice as if he was a Level 2 Wizard")), sub: ()), (runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Triumvirate of Blood:"), (emph: "", text: " After attacking with Nazgharoth each close combat phase (before Stomps), you may pick one of the following effects. You may not choose the same effect in two consecutive rounds of combat.")), sub: (((emph: "bold", text: "Fires of Wrath:"), (emph: "", text: " Nazgharoth uses a Breath Weapon Attack with Strength 4 and the Flaming Attacks special rule.")), ((emph: "bold", text: "Furious Ruin:"), (emph: "", text: " Nazgharoth rolls 2D6 with its Stomp Attack this phase.")), ((emph: "bold", text: "Enraged Roar:"), (emph: "", text: " All models in base contact with Nazgharoth must pass a Toughness test or suffer 1 Wound with no saves allowed."))))))

