#items(((runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "The Breath of Life:"), (emph: "", text: " Aekold has the Regeneration (4+) special rule. In addition, any Character model in base contact with Aekold Helbrass also gains Regeneration (4+) as long as they are in contact with him. If Aekold is killed during a battle, roll a dice at the end of the turn that killed him. On a 4+ he recovers to full wounds, and is placed where the model was originally slain, at least 1\" away from any unit or Impassable Terrain.")), sub: ()),))

